{"seq":2,"slug":"functional-groups","title":"官能团分类与命名（Functional Groups: Classification and Nomenclature）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/structure-nomenclature/functional-groups","wordCount":2326,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"官能团分类与命名-functional-groups-classification-and-nomenclature\">官能团分类与命名（Functional Groups: Classification and Nomenclature）</h1><h2 id=\"引言\">引言</h2><p>有机化合物数量庞大——已知结构超过一亿种，且每年仍有数百万新化合物被合成或发现。面对如此浩瀚的分子世界，化学家需要一套系统的分类和命名方法。官能团（Functional Group）正是这套体系的核心概念：它是决定有机分子化学性质的特征原子团或化学键。同一类官能团无论出现在什么碳骨架上，都表现出相似的化学反应性——这使得有机化学从&quot;记忆百万个独立化合物&quot;简化为&quot;理解数十种官能团的通用行为&quot;。</p>\n<p>本文将系统介绍常见官能团的结构特征、分类层次和 IUPAC 命名规则，帮助读者建立从分子结构到系统名称的完整映射能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"官能团的核心概念\">官能团的核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"什么是官能团\">什么是官能团</h3><p>官能团是有机分子中决定其化学反应特性的原子或原子团。它可以是：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>特殊的化学键：如 C=C 双键、C≡C 三键</li>\n<li>含杂原子的基团：如 —OH（羟基）、—NH₂（氨基）、—COOH（羧基）</li>\n<li>特殊的原子排列方式：如苯环（芳香体系）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>官能团的重要性在于<strong>性质可预测性</strong>：一旦识别出分子中的官能团，就能预测该分子的主要化学行为。例如，所有含 —OH 的醇类化合物都能与金属钠反应放出氢气，都能被氧化为醛或酮，都能参与酯化反应——无论其碳链有多长。</p>\n<h3 id=\"碳骨架与官能团的关系\">碳骨架与官能团的关系</h3><p>有机分子可以被看作&quot;碳骨架 + 官能团&quot;的组合：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>碳骨架</strong>（Carbon Skeleton）：提供分子的基本框架，由 C—C 键和 C—H 键构成</li>\n<li><strong>官能团</strong>：附着在碳骨架上或嵌入其中，赋予分子特定的化学性质</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种&quot;骨架 + 官能团&quot;的思维方式是有机化学最重要的简化工具。它意味着只要掌握了碳骨架的基本类型（链状、支链、环状）和官能团的反应特征，就能理解和预测绝大多数有机反应。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  FG[&quot;官能团&quot;] --&gt; A[&quot;碳-碳不饱和键&quot;]&#10;  FG --&gt; B[&quot;含氧官能团&quot;]&#10;  FG --&gt; C[&quot;含氮官能团&quot;]&#10;  FG --&gt; D[&quot;含硫/卤素官能团&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; A1[&quot;C=C 烯基 (亲电加成)&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; A2[&quot;C≡C 炔基 (加成/末端酸性)&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; A3[&quot;芳环 (亲电取代)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[&quot;-OH 醇 / -O- 醚&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[&quot;-CHO 醛 / &gt;C=O 酮&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[&quot;-COOH 羧酸 / -COOR 酯&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[&quot;-NH₂ 氨基 (碱性/亲核)&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[&quot;-CONH₂ 酰胺 (碱性极弱)&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; C3[&quot;-C≡N 腈 (亲核加成)&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[&quot;-SH 巯基 / -S- 硫醚&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; D2[&quot;C-X 卤代烃 (离去基团)&quot;]\">graph TD\n  FG[\"官能团\"] --&gt; A[\"碳-碳不饱和键\"]\n  FG --&gt; B[\"含氧官能团\"]\n  FG --&gt; C[\"含氮官能团\"]\n  FG --&gt; D[\"含硫/卤素官能团\"]\n  A --&gt; A1[\"C=C 烯基 (亲电加成)\"]\n  A --&gt; A2[\"C≡C 炔基 (加成/末端酸性)\"]\n  A --&gt; A3[\"芳环 (亲电取代)\"]\n  B --&gt; B1[\"-OH 醇 / -O- 醚\"]\n  B --&gt; B2[\"-CHO 醛 / &gt;C=O 酮\"]\n  B --&gt; B3[\"-COOH 羧酸 / -COOR 酯\"]\n  C --&gt; C1[\"-NH₂ 氨基 (碱性/亲核)\"]\n  C --&gt; C2[\"-CONH₂ 酰胺 (碱性极弱)\"]\n  C --&gt; C3[\"-C≡N 腈 (亲核加成)\"]\n  D --&gt; D1[\"-SH 巯基 / -S- 硫醚\"]\n  D --&gt; D2[\"C-X 卤代烃 (离去基团)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"按杂原子和键型分类的主要官能团\">按杂原子和键型分类的主要官能团</h2><h3 id=\"含碳-碳不饱和键的官能团\">含碳-碳不饱和键的官能团</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>官能团</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>代表化合物</th>\n<th>特征反应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>碳碳双键</td>\n<td>C=C</td>\n<td>烯基</td>\n<td>乙烯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>=CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CH}_2\\text{=CH}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">=CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>亲电加成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>碳碳三键</td>\n<td>C≡C</td>\n<td>炔基</td>\n<td>乙炔 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>HC≡CH</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{HC≡CH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HC≡CH</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>加成、末端酸性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>芳环</td>\n<td>苯环</td>\n<td>芳基（Aryl）</td>\n<td>苯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>C</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mtext>H</mtext><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{C}_6\\text{H}_6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">H</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>亲电取代</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>烯烃中 π 电子云富集在双键上方和下方，成为亲电试剂进攻的目标。炔烃除加成外，末端氢的酸性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>pK</mtext><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pK}_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pK</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ≈ 25）使其可形成金属炔化物。芳环因 Hückel 芳香性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4n+2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> π 电子）而异常稳定，倾向于保持芳香体系而进行取代而非加成。</p>\n<h3 id=\"含氧官能团\">含氧官能团</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>官能团</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>化合物类别</th>\n<th>通式</th>\n<th>IUPAC 后缀</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>羟基</td>\n<td>—OH</td>\n<td>醇（Alcohol）</td>\n<td>R—OH</td>\n<td>-ol</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>醚键</td>\n<td>—O—</td>\n<td>醚（Ether）</td>\n<td>R—O—R&#39;</td>\n<td>用&quot;oxy&quot;前缀</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>醛基</td>\n<td>—CHO</td>\n<td>醛（Aldehyde）</td>\n<td>R—CHO</td>\n<td>-al</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酮基</td>\n<td>&gt;C=O</td>\n<td>酮（Ketone）</td>\n<td>R—CO—R&#39;</td>\n<td>-one</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>羧基</td>\n<td>—COOH</td>\n<td>羧酸（Carboxylic Acid）</td>\n<td>R—COOH</td>\n<td>-oic acid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酯基</td>\n<td>—COOR</td>\n<td>酯（Ester）</td>\n<td>R—COO—R&#39;</td>\n<td>-oate</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酸酐</td>\n<td>—CO—O—CO—</td>\n<td>酸酐（Anhydride）</td>\n<td>(RCO)₂O</td>\n<td>-anhydride</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>含氧官能团的反应活性从高到低大致为：酰氯 &gt; 酸酐 &gt; 酯 &gt; 羧酸 &gt; 醛 &gt; 酮 &gt; 醇 &gt; 醚。这一顺序反映了羰基碳亲电性的强弱和离去基团的优劣。</p>\n<h3 id=\"含氮官能团\">含氮官能团</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>官能团</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>化合物类别</th>\n<th>通式</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>氨基</td>\n<td>—NH₂</td>\n<td>伯胺（Primary Amine）</td>\n<td>R—NH₂</td>\n<td>碱性，亲核性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仲氨基</td>\n<td>&gt;NH</td>\n<td>仲胺（Secondary Amine）</td>\n<td>R₂NH</td>\n<td>碱性略强于伯胺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叔氨基</td>\n<td>&gt;N—</td>\n<td>叔胺（Tertiary Amine）</td>\n<td>R₃N</td>\n<td>仅碱性，无 N—H</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>酰胺基</td>\n<td>—CONH₂</td>\n<td>酰胺（Amide）</td>\n<td>R—CONH₂</td>\n<td>碱性极弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硝基</td>\n<td>—NO₂</td>\n<td>硝基化合物</td>\n<td>R—NO₂</td>\n<td>强吸电子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>腈基</td>\n<td>—C≡N</td>\n<td>腈（Nitrile）</td>\n<td>R—CN</td>\n<td>亲核加成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>亚胺</td>\n<td>&gt;C=N—</td>\n<td>亚胺（Imine）</td>\n<td>R₂C=NR</td>\n<td>Schiff 碱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>氮原子的孤对电子使含氮官能团普遍具有碱性和亲核性。酰胺是例外——氮上孤对电子与相邻羰基共轭，碱性大幅降低（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>pK</mtext><mi>b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{pK}_b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pK</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ≈ 14）。这一共轭效应正是蛋白质肽键稳定的化学基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"含硫和含卤素官能团\">含硫和含卤素官能团</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>官能团</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n<th>化合物类别</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>巯基</td>\n<td>—SH</td>\n<td>硫醇（Thiol）</td>\n<td>类似醇但酸性更强，臭味</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>硫醚键</td>\n<td>—S—</td>\n<td>硫醚（Thioether）</td>\n<td>亲核性强于氧醚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磺酰基</td>\n<td>—SO₂—</td>\n<td>砜（Sulfone）</td>\n<td>强吸电子基</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C—F</td>\n<td>C—F</td>\n<td>氟代烃</td>\n<td>键强，代谢稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C—Cl</td>\n<td>C—Cl</td>\n<td>氯代烃</td>\n<td>常见亲核取代底物</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C—Br</td>\n<td>C—Br</td>\n<td>溴代烃</td>\n<td>优良离去基团</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>C—I</td>\n<td>C—I</td>\n<td>碘代烃</td>\n<td>最佳离去基团</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>卤代烃在有机合成中作用关键：C—X 键的极性使碳带部分正电荷（δ⁺），成为亲核试剂进攻的靶点。离去能力 I⁻ &gt; Br⁻ &gt; Cl⁻ &gt; F⁻，与 C—X 键能的强弱呈反向关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"iupac-系统命名法\">IUPAC 系统命名法</h2><h3 id=\"命名的基本步骤\">命名的基本步骤</h3><p>国际纯粹与应用化学联合会（IUPAC）命名法是全球通用的有机化合物命名体系。其基本流程为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>选主链</strong>：找含最高优先级官能团的最长碳链</li>\n<li><strong>编号</strong>：使最高优先级官能团位号最小</li>\n<li><strong>命名取代基</strong>：标明取代基名称和位号</li>\n<li><strong>组装名称</strong>：取代基前缀 + 母体名 + 官能团后缀</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"官能团优先级\">官能团优先级</h3><p>当分子含有多个官能团时，优先级最高的作为后缀（主官能团），其余作为前缀。优先级从高到低：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>—COOH</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>—CHO</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>&gt;C=O</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>—OH</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mtext>—NH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>C=C</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>C≡C</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{—COOH} &gt; \\text{—CHO} &gt; \\text{&gt;C=O} &gt; \\text{—OH} &gt; \\text{—NH}_2 &gt; \\text{C=C} &gt; \\text{C≡C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">—COOH</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">—CHO</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&gt;C=O</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">—OH</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">—NH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C=C</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">C≡C</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如：4-氨基-3-羟基丁酸，其中羧酸为主官能团（后缀 -oic acid），羟基和氨基为取代基（前缀 hydroxy- 和 amino-）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"常用母体名称\">常用母体名称</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>碳数</th>\n<th>烷烃</th>\n<th>烯烃</th>\n<th>炔烃</th>\n<th>醇</th>\n<th>醛</th>\n<th>酸</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>methane</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>methanol</td>\n<td>methanal</td>\n<td>methanoic acid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>ethane</td>\n<td>ethene</td>\n<td>ethyne</td>\n<td>ethanol</td>\n<td>ethanal</td>\n<td>ethanoic acid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>propane</td>\n<td>propene</td>\n<td>propyne</td>\n<td>propanol</td>\n<td>propanal</td>\n<td>propanoic acid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>butane</td>\n<td>butene</td>\n<td>butyne</td>\n<td>butanol</td>\n<td>butanal</td>\n<td>butanoic acid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>pentane</td>\n<td>pentene</td>\n<td>pentyne</td>\n<td>pentanol</td>\n<td>pentanal</td>\n<td>pentanoic acid</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>hexane</td>\n<td>hexene</td>\n<td>hexyne</td>\n<td>hexanol</td>\n<td>hexanal</td>\n<td>hexanoic acid</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"命名实例详解\">命名实例详解</h3><p><strong>实例 1</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CH(OH)CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>COOH</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CH}_3\\text{CH(OH)CH}_2\\text{COOH}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH(OH)CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">COOH</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>最高优先级官能团：羧基（—COOH）</li>\n<li>最长含羧基碳链：4 碳 → 母体为 butanoic acid</li>\n<li>羟基在 3 号碳 → 3-hydroxy</li>\n<li>系统名：3-hydroxybutanoic acid（3-羟基丁酸）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实例 2</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>=CHCH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>CHO</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{CH}_2\\text{=CHCH}_2\\text{CH}_2\\text{CHO}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">=CHCH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CHO</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>最高优先级官能团：醛基（—CHO）</li>\n<li>最长含醛基碳链：5 碳 → 母体为 pentanal</li>\n<li>双键在 4 号碳 → 4-penten</li>\n<li>系统名：pent-4-enal（4-戊烯醛）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"常见命名与俗名对照\">常见命名与俗名对照</h2><p>许多重要的有机化合物除系统名外还有广泛使用的俗名（Common Names）。在学术文献中两者并用，学习者需要熟悉常见对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>俗名</th>\n<th>系统名</th>\n<th>结构</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>甲醛（Formaldehyde）</td>\n<td>Methanal</td>\n<td>HCHO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乙醛（Acetaldehyde）</td>\n<td>Ethanal</td>\n<td>CH₃CHO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丙酮（Acetone）</td>\n<td>Propan-2-one</td>\n<td>CH₃COCH₃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>醋酸（Acetic Acid）</td>\n<td>Ethanoic acid</td>\n<td>CH₃COOH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>甘油（Glycerol）</td>\n<td>Propane-1,2,3-triol</td>\n<td>HOCH₂CH(OH)CH₂OH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>苯酚（Phenol）</td>\n<td>Hydroxybenzene</td>\n<td>C₆H₅OH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>甲苯（Toluene）</td>\n<td>Methylbenzene</td>\n<td>C₆H₅CH₃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>氯仿（Chloroform）</td>\n<td>Trichloromethane</td>\n<td>CHCl₃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"官能团间的相互转化\">官能团间的相互转化</h2><p>官能团并非孤立存在，它们之间可以通过特定反应相互转化。这些转化关系构成了有机合成的&quot;路线图&quot;：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>醇 → 醛/酮</strong>：氧化（PCC、Jones 氧化、Swern 氧化）</li>\n<li><strong>醛 → 羧酸</strong>：进一步氧化（KMnO₄、CrO₃）</li>\n<li><strong>羧酸 → 酰氯</strong>：SOCl₂ 或 (COCl)₂</li>\n<li><strong>酰氯 → 酯</strong>：与醇反应</li>\n<li><strong>酰氯 → 酰胺</strong>：与胺反应</li>\n<li><strong>腈 → 羧酸</strong>：酸性水解</li>\n<li><strong>卤代烃 → 醇</strong>：SN2 反应（OH⁻ 作亲核试剂）</li>\n<li><strong>醇 → 卤代烃</strong>：HBr、SOCl₂ 或 PBr₃</li>\n</ul>\n<p>理解这些官能团间转化关系是掌握有机合成路线设计的基础。在后续&quot;合成策略&quot;章节中，我们将系统利用这些转化构建复杂分子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"生物分子中的官能团\">生物分子中的官能团</h2><p>生物分子（Biomolecules）是官能团在生命体中的集中体现：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>糖类</strong>：含多个羟基和一个醛基（醛糖）或酮基（酮糖），如葡萄糖（glucose）含五个羟基和一个醛基</li>\n<li><strong>氨基酸</strong>：同时含有氨基（—NH₂）和羧基（—COOH），通过肽键（酰胺键）连接成蛋白质</li>\n<li><strong>脂肪酸</strong>：长链羧酸，通过酯键与甘油连接形成脂肪（triglycerides）</li>\n<li><strong>核苷酸</strong>：含磷酸酯键、核糖（含羟基）和含氮碱基（酰胺、亚胺等官能团）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>识别生物分子中的官能团是理解生化反应机理的前提。例如，蛋白质的变性本质上是氢键（涉及酰胺 N—H 和 C=O）和二硫键（含硫官能团）的断裂与重排。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章小结\">本章小结</h2><p>官能团是有机化学的&quot;分类密码&quot;——通过识别分子中的官能团，我们可以预测其化学行为、选择适当的反应条件、设计合成路线。IUPAC 命名法则为每个有机分子提供了唯一的系统名称，使全球化学家能够无歧义地交流。</p>\n<p>关键要点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>官能团决定有机分子的化学性质，碳骨架决定物理性质（沸点、溶解度）</li>\n<li>含氧、含氮、含硫、含卤素官能团各有特征反应模式</li>\n<li>IUPAC 命名遵循&quot;最长链 + 最小编号 + 优先级排序&quot;三原则</li>\n<li>官能团间的转化关系构成有机合成的基础路线图</li>\n</ol>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"官能团分类与命名（Functional Groups: Classification and Nomenclature）","id":"官能团分类与命名-functional-groups-classification-and-nomenclature"},{"level":2,"text":"引言","id":"引言"},{"level":2,"text":"官能团的核心概念","id":"官能团的核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"什么是官能团","id":"什么是官能团"},{"level":3,"text":"碳骨架与官能团的关系","id":"碳骨架与官能团的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"按杂原子和键型分类的主要官能团","id":"按杂原子和键型分类的主要官能团"},{"level":3,"text":"含碳-碳不饱和键的官能团","id":"含碳-碳不饱和键的官能团"},{"level":3,"text":"含氧官能团","id":"含氧官能团"},{"level":3,"text":"含氮官能团","id":"含氮官能团"},{"level":3,"text":"含硫和含卤素官能团","id":"含硫和含卤素官能团"},{"level":2,"text":"IUPAC 系统命名法","id":"iupac-系统命名法"},{"level":3,"text":"命名的基本步骤","id":"命名的基本步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"官能团优先级","id":"官能团优先级"},{"level":3,"text":"常用母体名称","id":"常用母体名称"},{"level":3,"text":"命名实例详解","id":"命名实例详解"},{"level":2,"text":"常见命名与俗名对照","id":"常见命名与俗名对照"},{"level":2,"text":"官能团间的相互转化","id":"官能团间的相互转化"},{"level":2,"text":"生物分子中的官能团","id":"生物分子中的官能团"},{"level":2,"text":"本章小结","id":"本章小结"}],"prev":{"title":"碳的成键与杂化（Carbon Bonding and Hybridization）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/structure-nomenclature/carbon-bonding-hybridization"},"next":{"title":"立体化学：手性与构象（Stereochemistry: Chirality and Conformation）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/structure-nomenclature/stereochemistry"}}